      "content": "hey, i'm trying to really ramp up my metabolism for a cutting phase. i drink like 4-5 cups of black coffee every morning anyway so i have a pretty high caffeine tolerance. i was thinking of adding green tea extract to my morning routine to stack with the caffeine for a bigger boost. what's the max effective dose i can take of both together to really get things moving?",
